  ${\mathbf a}_{\{1,2,5\}} $  &  $[0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1]^{\text{\rm T}}$      &   ${\mathbf a}_{\{2,3,5\}} $    &   ${\mathbf a}_{\{1,3,5\}}- {\mathbf a}_{\{1,2,5\}} +{\mathbf a}_{\{1,2,3\}}=[1, 2, 0, 0, 1, 1]^{\text{\rm T}}$   \tabularnewline 
