  ${\mathbf a}_{\{1,3,5\}} $    & $[1, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1]^{\text{\rm T}}$  &   ${\mathbf a}_{\{3,4,5\}} $    & ${\mathbf a}_{\{1,4,5\}}- {\mathbf a}_{\{1,3,5\}} +{\mathbf a}_{\{1,3,4\}}=[0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1]^{\text{\rm T}}$ \tabularnewline  
